OL,3,CGerry Kelly was 'voice of sanity
OL,4,Cduring insane times', funeral hears
OL,6,FIn 2018, he revealed he had been
OL,7,Fdiagnosed with cancer two years
OL,8,Fearlier.
OL,10,FHundreds attended the service at St
OL,11,FNicholas Church in Ardglass, with The
OL,12,FPriests ` the band interviewed
OL,13,Fmultiple times by Kelly ` performing
OL,14,Fat the mass.
OL,16,FFather Brian D'Arcy, who shared a
OL,17,Flongstanding professional relationship
OL,18,Fwith Kelly, said his friend was "loved
OL,19,Fby thousands and thousands of people,
OL,20,Fnorth and south of the border".
OL,26,@zD@aOU|D@^O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G2/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
