PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785518372
OL,3,CGerry Kelly was 'voice of sanity
OL,4,Cduring insane times', funeral hears
OL,6,F"There's a sadness everywhere because
OL,7,FGerry was such a comforting presence,"
OL,8,Fhe said.
OL,10,F"This may be something that's not
OL,11,Foften thought about, but when you
OL,12,Fthink back to the times that we lived
OL,13,Fin in those days, when his show on a
OL,14,FFriday night, trying to get guests
OL,15,Finto Belfast that was being bombed,
OL,16,Ftrying to compete with the Late Late
OL,17,Fand with other shows across the land,
OL,18,Ftrying to be a regional broadcaster
OL,19,Fwith a national reputation ` that was
OL,20,Fno easy task and Gerry did that with
OL,21,Fan amazing amount of professionalism.
OL,26,@nD@AOUoD@fO]rD@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G3/9
OL,2,W/*% /*%/"-$+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BNI NewsCClean Feed FThis Day
FL,418,410,140,120,000,100
PN,41704
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785518372
OL,3,CGerry Kelly was 'voice of sanity
OL,4,Cduring insane times', funeral hears
OL,6,F"But most of all, just the warmth and
OL,7,Fthe joy and the peace and the comfort
OL,8,Fof his personality, and he gave us a
OL,9,Fsense of comfort, a sense of sanity
OL,10,Fduring insane times, and only a
OL,11,Fbroadcaster of his reputation, his
OL,12,Fability, could do that and carry us
OL,13,Fthrough a time that was such a
OL,14,Fdifficult time to come through.
OL,16,F"I don't think he ever got the credit
OL,17,Ffor being the voice of sanity during
OL,18,Finsane times, and it took a lot out of
OL,19,Fhim doing that. It wasn't easy."
OL,26,@nD@AOUxD@AOU{D@`O]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G4/9
