CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785518372
OL,3,CGerry Kelly was 'voice of sanity
OL,4,Cduring insane times', funeral hears
OL,6,FHe added: "It was Seamus Heaney who
OL,7,Fsaid that beautiful thing, 'If you
OL,8,Fhave the words, there's always the
OL,9,Fchance you'll find a how'.
OL,11,F"And Gerry had the words, and Gerry
OL,12,Fknew how to use words, and Gerry knew
OL,13,Fhow to persuade people who didn't want
OL,14,Fto come within a thousand miles of
OL,15,FBelfast to come in and be guarded and
OL,16,Fbe brought to studios and hopefully
OL,17,Fget home safe from it.
OL,19,F"He had the words and he had the know-
OL,20,Fhow to do it.
OL,26,@nD@KOUsD@AOU{D@AOU
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G5/9
