PN,41706
SC,0006
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785518372
OL,3,CGerry Kelly was 'voice of sanity
OL,4,Cduring insane times', funeral hears
OL,6,F"Gerry Kelly was a legend in
OL,7,Fbroadcasting, one of the few legends
OL,8,Fthat we've ever had, but a real legend
OL,9,Fwho will never die."
OL,11,FFr D'Arcy said that over the 17 years
OL,12,Fof the Kelly Show, the broadcaster
OL,13,Fhosted 1,000 hours of live TV,
OL,14,Finterviewing 3,500 guests with more
OL,15,Fthan 1,500 musical acts.
OL,17,FHe said the pair had a long
OL,18,Fconversation about "the possibilities
OL,19,Fof life, the possibilities of death"
OL,20,Fwhen Kelly received his terminal
OL,21,Fdiagnosis.
OL,26,@nD@AOUqD@TO]zD@TOU{D@dO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G6/9
