OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785518372
OL,3,CGerry Kelly was 'voice of sanity
OL,4,Cduring insane times', funeral hears
OL,6,F"He was prepared for his last days,"
OL,7,FFr D'Arcy said.
OL,9,F"He prepared the last interview with
OL,10,FSaint Peter as well as he prepared his
OL,11,Ffirst interview on Kelly, he was
OL,12,Fready, prepared for it.
OL,14,F"His faith was strong."
OL,26,@nD@AOUnD@dO]qD@AOUvD@AOUvD@WO]
OL,1,W~k4 jw=hw1 hw}h7}j7}            G7/9
