OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F417A1785518372
OL,3,CGerry Kelly was 'voice of sanity
OL,4,Cduring insane times', funeral hears
OL,6,FQuoting Irish poet John O'Donohue, he
OL,7,Fadded: "'Let us not look for you only
OL,8,Fin memory, where we would grow lonely
OL,9,Fwithout you. You would want us to find
OL,10,Fyou in presence, beside us when beauty
OL,11,Fbrightens, when kindness flows, and
OL,12,Fwhen music echoes the eternal tones'.
OL,14,F"That's Gerry.
OL,16,F"Gerry, may you continue to inspire us
OL,17,Ffrom your place in heaven. You deserve
OL,18,Fyour rest, my dear friend. Rest in
OL,19,Fpeace."
OL,26,@oD@HOUvD@AOUxD@AOU{D@GO]
